Package: altsubtest
Version: 0.0.1
Title: Test ALTREP Class for the Extract_array_subset Method
Description: A minimal ALTREP double class that implements the proposed
    Extract_array_subset method, with switchable misbehaviour, to test the
    MatrixSubset() and ArraySubset() hooks in R.
Author: Michael Sumner
Maintainer: Michael Sumner <mdsumner@gmail.com>
